src/lib.rs follows basic_pitch/note_creation.py and inference.py of the
same project and licence.

Bittner, Bosch, Rubinstein, Meseguer-Brocal, Ewert: "A Lightweight
Instrument-Agnostic Model for Polyphonic Note Transcription and Multipitch
Estimation", ICASSP 2022.
